T1  - The effects of methylene blue during and after cardiac arrest in a porcine model; a randomized, blinded, placebo-controlled study
AU  - Johannsen, Cecilie Munch
AU  - Nørholt, Casper
AU  - Baltsen, Cecilie
AU  - Eggertsen, Mark A.
AU  - Magnussen, Andreas
