TY  - JOUR
T1  - The relationship between diffusion heterogeneity and microstructural changes in high-grade gliomas using Monte Carlo simulations
AU  - Lee, Chu-Yu
AU  - Bennett, Kevin M.
AU  - Debbins, Josef P.
AU  - Choi, In-Young
AU  - Lee, Phil
JO  - Magnetic Resonance Imaging
VL  - 85
SP  - 108
