T1  - Kolmogorov n–width and Lagrangian physics-informed neural networks: A causality-conforming manifold for convection-dominated PDEs
AU  - Mojgani, Rambod
AU  - Balajewicz, Maciej
AU  - Hassanzadeh, Pedram
